#: model:distrib.types.marketings,desc:ug_base_distrib.type_3
msgid ""
"Marketing expenses related to collaborating with bloggers and influencers to"
" promote products. This includes fees for sponsored content, product "
"reviews, social media mentions, and any other activities aimed at leveraging"
" the blogger's audience to increase brand visibility, drive engagement, and "
"boost sales"
msgstr ""

#. module: ug_base_distrib
#: model:distrib.types.marketings,desc:ug_base_distrib.type_6
msgid ""
"Marketing expenses related to listing, building visibility, and promoting "
"products through physical retail stores. This includes listing fees, "
"merchandising, leaflets, posters, voblers, and promotional compensation, all"
" aimed at enhancing product placement and driving customer engagement and "
"purchases."
msgstr ""

#. module: ug_base_distrib
#: model:distrib.types.marketings,desc:ug_base_distrib.type_1
msgid ""
"Marketing expenses related to participation in trade fairs and exhibitions. "
"This includes booth rental, design and construction of the booth, shipping "
"and logistics, promotional materials (such as leaflets and banners), staff "
"costs, and any other expenses related to showcasing products and engaging "
"with potential clients or partners at the event"
msgstr ""

#. module: ug_base_distrib
#: model:distrib.types.marketings,desc:ug_base_distrib.type_2
msgid ""
"Marketing expenses related to promoting and selling products through "
"alternative channels such as museums, duty-free stores, and similar non-"
"traditional retail environments. This includes costs for product placement, "
"display setup, promotional materials, and any activities aimed at enhancing "
"visibility and driving sales in these specific locations."
msgstr ""

